#: block.py:153
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Vertoon Naam"

#: block.py:154
msgid "The display name for this component."
msgstr "Die vertoonnaam vir hierdie komponent."

#: block.py:158
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Teks"

#: block.py:160
msgid "Html contents to display for this block"
msgstr "Html-inhoud om vir hierdie blok te vertoon"

#: block.py:162
msgid "Upstream html contents to store upstream data field"
msgstr "Opstroom HTML-inhoud om opstroom data veld te stoor"

#: block.py:169
msgid "Source code for LaTeX documents. This feature is not well-supported."
msgstr ""
"Bronkode vir LaTeX-dokumente. Hierdie kenmerk word nie goed ondersteun nie."

#: block.py:171
msgid "Enable LaTeX templates?"
msgstr "Aktiveer LaTeX-sjablone?"

#: block.py:174
msgid ""
"Select Visual to enter content and have the editor automatically create the "
"HTML. Select Raw to edit HTML directly. If you change this setting, you must"
" save the component and then re-open it for editing."
msgstr ""
"Kies Visueel om inhoud in te voer en laat die redigeerder outomaties die "
"HTML skep. Kies Raw om HTML direk te wysig. As jy hierdie instelling "
"verander, moet jy die komponent stoor en dit dan weer oopmaak vir "
"redigering."

#: block.py:177
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "Redakteur"

#: block.py:179
msgid "Visual"
msgstr "Visueel"

#: block.py:179
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "Rou"
